656
00:37:41,367 --> 00:37:43,733
因为你根本不是车迷。
'Cause you're not really
a big car fan.

657
00:37:43,767 --> 00:37:46,067
呃，不，我的第一辆车简直灾难。
Uh, no, my first car
was a disaster.

658
00:37:46,100 --> 00:37:48,633
-是 MG Midget，那种小白车。-是啊。
-It was an MG Midget. You know
those little white things.
-Yeah.

659
00:37:48,667 --> 00:37:51,767
我兄弟，兄弟把它卖给了我。
My brother, my brother
sold it to me.

660
00:37:51,800 --> 00:37:54,333
发动机两天内就炸了。
The engine blew up
within two days.

661
00:37:54,367 --> 00:37:55,867
(观众笑)
(AUDIENCE LAUGHING)

662
00:37:55,900 --> 00:37:59,533
-那你不有一辆高尔夫 GTI 吗？-有的，有的。
-But didn't you have
a Golf GTI?
-Yes, I did, I did.

663
00:37:59,567 --> 00:38:02,367
结果它悲剧收场，我那可怜的老高尔夫 GTI。
That came to a sticky end,
my poor old Golf GTI.

664
00:38:02,400 --> 00:38:03,700
怎么了？到底怎么弄的？
Why? What happened to it?

665
00:38:03,733 --> 00:38:06,933
其实，我那时候在演剧，呃…
Well, I was
doing theater in, um...

666
00:38:06,967 --> 00:38:10,200
在老…不，是伦敦的 Young Vic，呃，沃特卢那儿，
At the old...
Uh, no, the Young Vic,
excuse me, in Waterloo,

667
00:38:10,233 --> 00:38:12,500
我刚把衣橱清空
and I'd just cleared
out my closet

668
00:38:12,533 --> 00:38:16,067
想把这些东西都送去慈善商店。
and I had all this stuff
to take to the charity shop.

669
00:38:16,100 --> 00:38:17,967
然后我想，‘哎呀，你懂的…’
And then I thought,
"Well, you know..."

670
00:38:18,000 --> 00:38:20,333
那儿根本没有慈善店，我也抽不出时间。
There were no charity shops.
I didn't have the time.

671
00:38:20,367 --> 00:38:24,567
我知道大家都说，“把车锁好，
And I knew that everyone said,
"Keep your car
locked around here,

672
00:38:24,600 --> 00:38:26,267
因为这里的东西很容易被偷。”
"because things get
nicked out of the car."

673
00:38:26,300 --> 00:38:29,000
于是我想，“完美，我把东西留在车里，
So I thought,
"Perfect, I'll leave
my stuff in the car,

674
00:38:29,033 --> 00:38:31,833
把车门敞开，全部被偷。”
"I'll leave the car open,
and it'll all get nicked."

675
00:38:31,867 --> 00:38:35,033
可是，东西没被偷，我的车被点燃了。
But instead of the stuff
getting nicked,
my car got torched.

676
00:38:35,067 --> 00:38:36,567
(全场笑)
(ALL LAUGHING)

677
00:38:36,600 --> 00:38:39,800
-不！-是啊。我出来时，车就像…绿巨人一样。
-No!
-Yeah. I came out,
it was like this just... Hulk.

678
00:38:39,833 --> 00:38:43,067
-那你现在有什么？-其实我现在根本没有车。
-So what have you got now?
-I don't have a car now,
actually.

679
00:38:43,100 --> 00:38:47,267
-你没 Oyster 卡吗？-有啊。对，没错。
-Haven't you got an
Oyster card?
-Yes, I do. Yep. Yeah.

680
00:38:47,300 --> 00:38:51,500
-那是什么？-很棒的东西。就是这么个小玩意儿。
-What is one?
-It's a brilliant thing.
It's this little thing.

681
00:38:51,533 --> 00:38:58,300
而且坐公共交通，比如公交、地铁和火车时，
And when you go on public
transport, which are like
buses and tubes and trains,

682
00:38:58,333 --> 00:39:01,400
你拿出那张小卡片刷一下，然后……（配音）上车了。
you have this little card
and you swipe it and...
(VOCALISES) You're on.

683
00:39:01,433 --> 00:39:03,200
不过，为什么不直接开车呢？
Why wouldn't you
go in a car, though?

684
00:39:03,233 --> 00:39:05,433
你坐在公交上，前面还有个穿制服的司机开车，
You sit on the bus,
and there's a chauffeur
driving the bus,

685
00:39:05,467 --> 00:39:07,433
你懂的，就是那套制服的。
you know in a uniform.

686
00:39:07,467 --> 00:39:09,167
-旁边还有个流浪汉，呕吐在你身上。-当然也有好人……
-And a tramp sitting
next to you, vomiting on you.
-And there are nice people...

687
00:39:09,200 --> 00:39:10,833
-才不要。（全体笑）
-No.
-(ALL LAUGHING)

688
00:39:10,867 --> 00:39:13,433
我们能简短聊聊超跑吗？如果可以的话……
Can we talk about
supercars briefly?
If I may...

689
00:39:13,467 --> 00:39:16,133
-什么叫超跑？-法拉利、兰博基尼。
-What's a supercar?
-Ferraris, Lamborghinis.

690
00:39:16,167 --> 00:39:18,133
你们对那个……那种车怎么看？
Where are you on... On those?

691
00:39:18,167 --> 00:39:20,367
-你觉得……呃，你懂的…… -这个嘛……
-What do you think
of a... You know...
-Well...

692
00:39:20,400 --> 00:39:22,600
中年大爷开兰博基尼？
A middle-aged chap
in a Lambo?

693
00:39:22,633 --> 00:39:24,433
呃，我觉得……
Well, I think...

694
00:39:24,467 --> 00:39:28,067
我只是觉得大多数开这种车的家伙……
Well, I just think most
guys who drive those...

695
00:39:28,067 --> 00:39:30,500
每次看到他们，我总是想，哔——，你懂的。
When I see them,
I always thought,
(BLEEP) you know.

696
00:39:30,533 --> 00:39:32,500
（观众笑声）
(AUDIENCE LAUGHING)

697
00:39:32,533 --> 00:39:34,400
-我的意思是……（掌声）
-I mean...
-(APPLAUSE)

698
00:39:34,433 --> 00:39:36,500
哦。
Oh.

699
00:39:36,533 --> 00:39:39,100
抱歉，我本来想说……
Sorry. I was gonna say...

700
00:39:39,133 --> 00:39:40,367
我本来想说……
I was gonna say...

701
00:39:40,400 --> 00:39:43,500
真是可怜，因为理查德·哈蒙德有一辆。
That's sad, 'cause
Richard Hammond's got one.

702
00:39:43,533 --> 00:39:46,067
-哦，他没有吧？哦，不，亲爱的…… -他有。
-Oh, he hasn't, has he?
Oh, no. Dear...
-He has.

703
00:39:46,067 --> 00:39:49,900
他不是笨蛋，挺好的人。所以，理查德，对不起啊。
He's not a pillock.
He's a nice guy.
So I'm sorry, Richard.

704
00:39:49,933 --> 00:39:51,167
-他是吗？-是的。
-Is he?
-Yeah.

705
00:39:51,200 --> 00:39:53,900
-我还以为他是笨蛋呢。（全体笑）
-I thought he was a pillock.
-(ALL LAUGHING)

706
00:39:53,933 --> 00:39:57,333
好吧，这圈显然是主角。好玩吗？
So, okay. The lap, obviously.
Was it fun?

707
00:39:57,367 --> 00:39:59,867
它……嗯，我不知道‘好玩’是不是合适的词。
It... Well, I don't know
if fun is the right word.

708
00:39:59,900 --> 00:40:02,467
它简直恐怖，紧张得要命。
It was terrifying.
It was nerve-racking.

709
00:40:02,500 --> 00:40:05,100
肾上腺素喷射啊。
It was adrenaline-pumping.

710
00:40:05,133 --> 00:40:07,833
到最后我手都抖成这样。
My hands were shaking
like this at the end.

711
00:40:07,867 --> 00:40:09,633
简直出汗啊。
It was sweat-making.

712
00:40:09,667 --> 00:40:12,367
它……它太棒了。
It was... It was fabulous.

713
00:40:12,400 --> 00:40:14,133
-你喜欢吗？-太棒了。
-You did like it?
-It was fabulous.

714
00:40:14,167 --> 00:40:18,100
-哦，我就想这么说。（说话模糊）-（全体笑）
-Oh, that's what I thought.
(TALKS INDISTINCTLY)
-(ALL LAUGHING)

715
00:40:18,133 --> 00:40:20,467
-我们看看吧？-观众：要！
-Shall we have a look at it?
-AUDIENCE: Yes!

716
00:40:20,500 --> 00:40:25,300
好，抱歉电视这边有点问题，开始啦。感觉像回到六十年代。
Right. Sorry about
the television but here we go.
It's like being in the '60s.

717
00:40:25,333 --> 00:40:28,533
-（轮胎尖叫声）-克拉克森：这起步够狠的。
-(TYRE SCREECH)
-CLARKSON:
That's an aggressive start.

718
00:40:28,567 --> 00:40:31,833
后面更硬，更久。
Later, harder, longer.

719
00:40:31,867 --> 00:40:33,967
后面更硬……
Later, harder...

720
00:40:34,067 --> 00:40:37,300
-你在那边播航运预报吗？-（全体笑）
-Are you doing the shipping
forecast in there?
-(ALL LAUGHING)

721
00:40:37,333 --> 00:40:39,567
道格拉斯，狗仔……
Douglas, Dogger...

722
00:40:39,600 --> 00:40:42,067
克拉克森：硬点。
莫琳：慢点。
CLARKSON: Hard.
HELEN MIRREN: Slow.

723
00:40:42,067 --> 00:40:44,333
再来一次。更硬。
Later. Harder.

724
00:40:44,367 --> 00:40:48,433
克拉克森：法罗岛。是斯提格叫你这么做的吗？
莫琳：他说了。
CLARKSON: Faroe. Is that
what The Stig told you to do?
MIRREN: He did.

725
00:40:48,467 --> 00:40:51,067
克拉克森：他叫你这么做了吗？
慢点。更硬。
-CLARKSON:
Did he tell you to do that?
-Slower. Harder.

726
00:40:51,067 --> 00:40:54,233
进弯慢，出弯快。
Slow into the corners
and then fast out.

727
00:40:54,267 --> 00:40:58,167
克拉克森：所以是慢的。现在快！快！
快，快！
-CLARKSON:
So it's slow. Now go. Go!
-Go, go!

728
00:40:58,200 --> 00:41:00,800
你这个笨蛋！
You idiot!

729
00:41:00,833 --> 00:41:03,167
莫琳：我的脏话其实比那还要更——
MIRREN: My language
is actually a lot bluer
than that.

730
00:41:03,200 --> 00:41:04,633
克拉克森：哦，是啊。
CLARKSON: Oh, yes.

731
00:41:04,667 --> 00:41:06,400
克拉克森：现在开始，我们要冲出了。
CLARKSON:
Here we go now.
We're coming out.

732
00:41:06,433 --> 00:41:09,467
莫琳：这车子看起来真是古蠢。
MIRREN: It's such
a silly-looking little car.

733
00:41:09,500 --> 00:41:11,067
克拉克森：你喜欢吗？
不。
-CLARKSON: Did you like it?
-No.

734
00:41:11,067 --> 00:41:13,133
克拉克森：不，糟透了，是吧？
（轮胎尖叫声）
-CLARKSON:
No, it's awful, isn't it?
-(TYRES SCREECH)

735
00:41:13,167 --> 00:41:16,167
哦，是啊。
Oh, yes.

736
00:41:16,200 --> 00:41:18,867
莫琳：我最喜欢那段。
克拉克森：我喜欢在那儿切弯。
MIRREN: I liked that bit best.
CLARKSON: I like cutting
the corner there.

737
00:41:18,900 --> 00:41:21,067
克拉克森：现在我们真的加速了。
CLARKSON:
Now we're really
picking up speed.

738
00:41:21,067 --> 00:41:22,767
（嗡嗡声）
(WHIRRING)

739
00:41:22,800 --> 00:41:24,400
克拉克森：档位错了。
CLARKSON:
That's the wrong gear.

740
00:41:24,433 --> 00:41:26,233
莫琳：哦，是吗？是四挡吗？你能说清吗？
MIRREN: Oh, is it?
Is that fourth? Can you tell?

741
00:41:26,267 --> 00:41:29,633
克拉克森：是三挡。车子在……（哼）
莫琳：哦，是啊。
CLARKSON: It was third.
It was going... (VOCALISES)
MIRREN: Oh, yeah.

742
00:41:29,667 --> 00:41:31,300
克拉克森：因为她现在真的在加速。
CLARKSON: Because she's really
picking up speed now.

743
00:41:31,333 --> 00:41:34,067
这里是迈克尔·甘邦的弯，我们差点把他甩了。
This is Michael Gambon's
corner, where we nearly
lost him.

744
00:41:34,067 --> 00:41:35,800
莫琳：哦，是啊。
克拉克森：然后在那儿。
MIRREN: Oh, yeah.
CLARKSON: And round there.

745
00:41:35,833 --> 00:41:38,733
各位女士们先生们，我们已经冲过终点线了。
And there we are,
ladies and gentlemen,
across the line.

746
00:41:38,767 --> 00:41:40,933
（掌声）
呼——！
-(APPLAUSE)
-Whoo-hoo!

747
00:41:45,200 --> 00:41:46,667
克拉克森：所以…
CLARKSON: So...

748
00:41:51,067 --> 00:41:54,367
奇迹般地在火灾中完好无损……（莫琳轻笑）
-Miraculously
undamaged in the fire...
-(MIRREN CHUCKLES)

749
00:41:54,400 --> 00:41:56,067
是我们的板子。
Is our board.

750
00:41:56,067 --> 00:41:59,400
——你们起火了？
——第五频道把我们所有东西都点燃了。
-You had a fire?
-Channel 5 set fire
to everything we own.

751
00:41:59,433 --> 00:42:01,367
——不！
——说实话，真的点着了。
-No!
-Honestly, they did.

752
00:42:01,400 --> 00:42:04,500
所以我们只能坐破旧家具。我很抱歉。总之，这玩意儿活了下来。
That's why we're in rubbish
furniture. I apologize.
Anyway, but this survived.

753
00:42:04,533 --> 00:42:07,333
那你们现在觉得自己跑到哪儿去了？
And where do you think
you've come now?

754
00:42:07,367 --> 00:42:11,533
——如果这是戏剧区。
——好吧，我在戏剧区吗？
-If this is the thespian zone.
-Yes, well, am I in
the thespian zone?

755
00:42:11,567 --> 00:42:13,500
克拉克森：是啊。
（大家笑）
-CLARKSON: Yes.
-(ALL LAUGHING)

756
00:42:13,533 --> 00:42:15,833
克拉克森：雷·温斯通。克里斯汀·斯科特·托马斯。
莫琳：对。
CLARKSON: Ray Winstone.
Kristin Scott Thomas.
MIRREN: Yes.

757
00:42:15,867 --> 00:42:18,700
克拉克森：瑞克·韦克曼不是演员。好吧，其实他是。
CLARKSON:
Rick Wakeman is not a thesp.
Well, he is, actually.

758
00:42:18,733 --> 00:42:21,067
还有布赖恩·考克斯和吉米·卡尔，前者是喜剧演员。
And then Brian Cox
and Jimmy Carr,
who was a comedian.

759
00:42:21,100 --> 00:42:22,200
嗯——我真的不知道。
Mmm-hmm. I have no idea.

760
00:42:22,233 --> 00:42:24,800
——准备好了吗？一……
——是的。
-Ready? One...
-Yes.

761
00:42:24,833 --> 00:42:26,267
-五十…
-哦。
-Fifty...
-Oh.

762
00:42:26,300 --> 00:42:28,367
不。你说的“哦”到底什么意思？
No. What do you mean, "Oh"?

763
00:42:28,400 --> 00:42:30,467
-两点八。
-哦！
-Two point eight.
-Oh!

764
00:42:30,500 --> 00:42:32,233
-不错啊。
-这就把你正好…
-Not bad.
-Which puts you right...

765
00:42:32,267 --> 00:42:33,633
(APPLAUSE)
(APPLAUSE)

766
00:42:34,767 --> 00:42:36,467
谢谢。
Thank you.

767
00:42:41,133 --> 00:42:43,767
-MIRREN：不太高。
-那你拿了几个奥斯卡？一个？
-MIRREN: Not very high up.
-So how many Oscars
have you won? One?

768
00:42:43,800 --> 00:42:45,233
-一个奥斯卡，没错。
-艾美奖呢？
-One Oscar, yeah.
-Emmies?

769
00:42:45,267 --> 00:42:46,333
呃，四个。
Uh, four.

770
00:42:46,367 --> 00:42:48,267
-金球奖？
-我想是三个。
-Golden Globes?
-Three, I think.

771
00:42:48,300 --> 00:42:52,267
三个。而且现在发现你在我们赛道上的圈速比里克·韦克曼还快。
Three. And now it turns out
you're faster round our track
than Rick Wakeman.

772
00:42:52,300 --> 00:42:56,400
-女士们，先生们，海伦·米伦爵士。
-太壮观了！谢谢。
-Ladies and gentlemen,
Dame Helen Mirren.
-What a triumph! Thank you.

773
00:42:56,433 --> 00:42:58,733
(AUDIENCE CHEERING)
(AUDIENCE CHEERING)

774
00:43:00,500 --> 00:43:07,600
好了。现在，是时候来玩酷炫墙了！
Right. Now, now it is time
to do the Cool Wall!

775
00:43:07,620 --> 00:43:09,620
(APPLAUSE)
(APPLAUSE)

776
00:43:10,100 --> 00:43:10,700
哦耶。
Oh yeah.

777
00:43:14,000 --> 00:43:21,100
不幸的是，酷炫墙在我们的火灾中成了主要受害者
Unfortunately, unfortunately the Cool Wall
was one of the major casualties in our fire

778
00:43:21,120 --> 00:43:26,120
但我们会坚持下去。
-是的，我们会的！
我们就从这个开始！
but we will persevere.
- Yes we will!
And we're gonna kick off with this!

779
00:43:26,140 --> 00:43:27,940
好！
(AUDIENCE LAUGHING)
Yes!
(AUDIENCE LAUGHING)

780
00:43:27,960 --> 00:43:31,060
这……
-是高尔夫吗？
It's...
- Is it a Golf?

781
00:43:31,080 --> 00:43:34,180
不，更像阿尔法。
-灯光呢？
No, looks more an Alfa.
- What about the headlamps?

782
00:43:34,200 --> 00:43:37,600
是啊，我觉得是阿尔法。
你觉得这是什么？
Yeah, I think it's an Alfa.
What do you think that is?

783
00:43:39,600 --> 00:43:44,200
是奥迪。
-你的人生有多空虚啊！？
It's an Audi.
- How empty is your life!?

784
00:43:44,220 --> 00:43:46,920
(AUDIENCE LAUGHING)
居然能从这张照片判断出它是奥迪？
(AUDIENCE LAUGHING)
That you are able to determine

785
00:43:46,940 --> 00:43:50,840
这张照片能确定是奥迪？这根本办不到。
that this is an Audi from that photograph?
This isn't working.

786
00:43:50,860 --> 00:43:55,460
这真的不行。我的意思是，即使我们把它们挂起来，也没啥看头。
This is not working. I mean, even if we
could put them up, it wouldn't be much cop.

787
00:43:55,480 --> 00:43:57,880
全毁了。酷炫墙彻底毁了。
-抱歉。
This is ruined. The Cool Wall's ruined.
- Sorry.

788
00:43:57,900 --> 00:44:05,000
呃，当Vicki Butler‑Henderson把酷炫墙烧掉时，她以为自己把我们晃晕了。
Um, when Vicki Butler-Henderson burned the
Cool Wall, she thought she'd flummoxed us.

789
00:44:05,020 --> 00:44:08,720
但没关系，因为我们要继续做点不着火的东西，
But it doesn't matter because we're gonna
move on to something that isn't burned,

790
00:44:08,740 --> 00:44:11,540
詹姆斯·梅没被烧！
